window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An untamed witch. A forgotten past. An unknown legacy.</p> <p>The nightmares have faded, but the real fight is only just beginning.</p> <p>Newly independent Paladin Agent Alice Skye is finally putting her life back together. She’s escaped a cult, taken down a corrupt druid, and things are starting to sizzle with London’s most eligible bachelor, Riley Storm. But her fragile balance is shattered when stolen Fae artefacts, missing hearts, and a tight-lipped detective pull her into a web of gruesome murders.<br> <br> To uncover the truth, Alice must break through Detective Peyton’s walls, especially since his dangerous secret holds the key to solving the case. But as the Council watches her every move, quietly deliberating her fate, Alice’s future hangs by a thread.<br> <br> Can she survive their judgment—or will the weight of her own ancestry be her undoing?</p> <p><i>Elemental's Curse</i> is the fourth instalment of the dark, twisted, urban fantasy series containing explicit content, graphic violence, profanity, and topics that may be sensitive to some listeners. Full details can be found listed inside the book.</p> <p>Disclaimer: This novel is written in British English including spelling and grammar.</p>"; 
